
---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Suvni tejash — kelajakni asrash"
  description="Kundalik hayotda suvni tejash va tabiatni asrash bo‘yicha foydali tavsiyalar."
>
  <article class="container article-page">
    <a class="back-link" href="../">
      ← Barcha maqolalarga qaytish
    </a>

    <p class="article-category">Jamiyat</p>

    <h1>Suvni tejash — kelajakni asrash</h1>

    <p class="article-intro">
      Suv — hayot manbai. Uni tejash har birimizning kundalik
      vazifamizdir.
    </p>

    <div class="article-body">
      <h2>Nima uchun suvni tejash kerak?</h2>
      <p>
        Toza suv insonlar, hayvonlar va o‘simliklar hayoti uchun
        juda muhim. Suvdan isrofgarchiliksiz foydalanish tabiiy
        resurslarni asrashga yordam beradi.
      </p>

      <h2>Suvni tejashning oddiy usullari</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Tish yuvayotganda jo‘mrakni yopib turing.</li>
        <li>Suv oqayotgan jo‘mrak va quvurlarni ta’mirlang.</li>
        <li>Idish yuvishda suvni ortiqcha oqizmang.</li>
        <li>O‘simliklarni kerakli miqdorda sug‘oring.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Xulosa</h2>
      <p>
        Har bir kichik qadam muhim. Suvni bugun tejash orqali
        kelajak avlodlar uchun ham bu bebaho boylikni asrashga
        hissa qo‘shamiz.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .article-page {
    max-width: 850px;
    padding-top: 48px;
    padding-bottom: 72px;
  }

  .back-link {
    color: var(--green, #14532d);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .article-category {
    margin-top: 32px;
    color: var(--green, #14532d);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .article-page h1 {
    color: var(--ink, #17251c);
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .article-intro {
    color: var(--muted, #69766d);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .article-body {
    margin-top: 32px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .article-body h2 {
    margin-top: 28px;
    color: var(--ink, #17251c);
  }
</style>
